{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:37 2026-10-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:37 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:37 2026-10-18 HKT</p><img alt=\"4隻狗屍被棄置，案件待查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/298215327d771308e9c1175fa8d50ca4/2026-10/page1_9.jpg\"/><p>今日（18日）早上11時35分，警方接獲途人報案，指在元朗新田合盛圍一魚塘旁邊，發現4隻狗屍，懷疑牠們遭人毒殺。警員接報趕到，現場是青山公路新田段，所見4隻狗屍被棄置在魚塘旁邊的垃圾堆中，屍體交錯重疊在一起，並惹來蒼蠅。</p><p>據了解，4隻狗屍由動物義工發現並報案，全部為黑色狗隻，其中一隻狗植有晶片。其後警方通知愛護動物協會派員到場協助，正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"4隻狗屍被棄置在魚塘旁邊的垃圾堆中。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0cdee72e6ae2bb452c5b624bf0a28da2/2026-10/10_4.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4226899eca2a8946e5f1af3c90c16cf2/2026-10/9_2_2.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"4隻狗屍交錯重疊在一起，並惹來蒼蠅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af4e2363c370b9d90995240b20ca1d28/2026-10/8_0_5.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a79336ab31908a4e5776b01653bce783/2026-10/6_6.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ec78129a4732bd3077119f81e89048d/2026-10/5_1_13.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是合盛圍一魚塘旁邊的垃圾堆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/58937067462ab66937232ff0c0a36c28/2026-10/4_1_13.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8eb12b0ee64ec9e730215a347a92e05b/2026-10/3_3_16.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/130ae2c7e26bed75c1463cf60793b3a5/2026-10/2_0_22.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c2f113b558c1414c2329ea621fddfbb2/2026-10/1_4_2.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T05:59:17.512896+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":256,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T05:37:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T05:57:35.361034+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T05:57:35.361034+00:00","content_hash":"182f8a8647c4a3afe0eb5cc24a282a1892992da05dc670bf5855a9d54d43ed47","evidenc